      "body": "@ronhuafeng Hi! Would you mind taking a look at this small PR?\r\n\r\nThis PR only adds a startup warning to make the effective prefill cap visible.\r\nI noticed that this warning seemed relevant to the confusion discussed in your [comment](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/29358#issuecomment-4824546224) \r\nIt only touches `server_args.py`, which does not seem to have an automatic [CODEOWNER ](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/CODEOWNERS)reviewer, so no reviewer was requested automatically.",
      "created_at": "2026-07-05T22:09:12Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29531#issuecomment-4887755834",
      "id": 4887755834,
      "updated_at": "2026-07-05T22:11:02Z",
