    {
      "body": "@hnyls2002 Hi! Could you take a quick look at this small diagnostic PR?\r\n\r\nIt adds a startup warning for a non-obvious chunked prefill behavior: with fixed chunked prefill, the effective prefill batch budget is `min(max_prefill_tokens, chunked_prefill_size)`.\r\n\r\nI traced this to the `PrefillAdder` scheduling logic, and it seemed related to your work on the chunked-prefill scheduler.\r\n\r\n`server_args.py` doesn't have a direct CODEOWNERS match, so no reviewer was assigned automatically.\r\n\r\nMore details [here](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29531#issue-4760212609)\r\n",
      "created_at": "2026-07-13T12:50:05Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29531#issuecomment-4958119267",
      "id": 4958119267,
      "updated_at": "2026-07-13T12:54:05Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "ntny"
      }
    },
